OL,3,GNEWSADouble murder investigation
OL,4,Alaunched over two deaths in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA double murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after two men died in Glasgow
OL,8,Fat the weekend.
OL,10,FThe bodies of Paul Lafferty, 50, and
OL,11,FGary Beaton, 54, were found in a flat
OL,12,Fin Partick's Chancellor Street about
OL,13,F16:40 on Sunday.
OL,15,FPolice Scotland said it was treating
OL,16,Fthe two deaths as murder and appealed
OL,17,Ffor anyone with any information to come
OL,18,Fforward.
OL,20,FDetectives believe a knife was used
OL,21,Fduring the incident.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
